    obo:IAO_0000115 "An upper respiratory tract disease involving inflammation of the nasal cavities and trachea caused by feline herpesvirus 1, of the family Herpesviridae in cats and especially young kittens that is characterized by sneezing, conjunctivitis with discharge, and nasal discharges."@en ;
