    obo:IAO_0000115 "A California virus encephalitis that results_in inflammation located_in brain, has_material_basis_in Snowshoe hare virus, which is transmitted_by Aedes mosquitoes. The infection has_symptom headache, has_symptom fever, has_symptom anorexia, and has_symptom seizures."@en ;
    oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace "disease_ontology" ;
    oboInOwl:id "DOID:0050171" ;
