    obo:IAO_0000115 "A viral infectious disease that is a hemorrhagic fever, has_material_basis_in Whitewater Arroyo virus (Mammarenavirus whitewaterense), which is transmitted_by white-throated woodrats (Neotoma albigula). The infection has_symptom fever, has_symptom headache, has_symptom myalgia, and has_symptom hemorrhagic manifestations."@en ;
