    obo:IAO_0000115 "A parasitic helminthiasis infectious disease that involves infection caused by parasitic worms, which are bilaterian, unsegmented, soft-bodied invertebrate animals with no body cavity."@en ;
    oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace "disease_ontology" ;
