    rdfs:label "bacillary angiomatosis"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A bartonellosis that has_material_basis_in Bartonella henselae or has_material_basis_in Bartonella quintana. The disease is characterized by the proliferation of blood vessels, resulting in them forming tumour-like masses in the skin and other organs."@en ;
