    rdfs:label "congenital myopathy 13"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A congenital myopathy that is characterized by congenital weakness, arthrogryposis, cleft palate, ptosis, myopathic facies, short stature, kykphoscoliosis, talipes deformities and susceptibility to malignant hyperthermia provoked by anesthesia and that has_material_basis_in homozygous mutation in the STAC3 gene on chromosome 12q13."@en ;
