    obo:IAO_0000115 "A syndrome characterized by permanent parathyroid hormone (PTH) deficiency, hypocalcemia, hyperphosphatemia, facial anomalies, and psychomotor retardation that has_material_basis_in homozygous or compound heterozygous mutation in the TBCE gene on chromosome 1q42.3."@en ;
