    obo:IAO_0000115 "A congenital fibrosis of the extraocular muscles that is characterized by bilateral ptosis and restrictive ophthalmoplegia with the globes fixed in extreme abduction (exotropia) and that has_material_basis_in homozygous mutation in the ARIX gene on chromosome 11q13."@en ;
