    rdfs:label "Sandestig-Stefanova syndrome"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A syndrome that is characterized by microcephaly, trigonocephaly, congenital cataracts, microphthalmia, facial findings, camptodactyly, periventricular white matter loss, thin corpus callosum, delayed myelination, and poor prognosis and that has_material_basis_in homozygous mutation in the NUP188 gene on chromosome 9q34."@en ;
