    obo:IAO_0000115 "An essential tremor that is characterized by adult-onset kinetic and/or postural tremor usually affecting the upper limbs and that has_material_basis_in heterozygous trinucleotide GGC repeat expansion in the 5-prime untranslated region of the NOTCH2NLC gene on chromosome 1q21."@en ;
