    obo:IAO_0000115 "An oculopharyngodistal myopathy that is characterized by progressive muscle weakness with ocular, facial, pharyngeal, and distal limb involvement, resulting in dysarthria and gait difficulties and that has_material_basis_in heterozygous trinucleotide repeat expansion (CGG) in the 5-prime untranslated region (UTR) of the NOTCH2NLC gene on chromosome 1q21."@en ;
