    obo:IAO_0000115 "An oculopharyngodistal myopathy that is characterized by progressive ptosis, ophthalmoparesis, facial and masseter weakness, and muscle weakness of the distal limbs and that has_material_basis_in heterozygous trinucleotide repeat expansion (CGG) in the 5-prime untranslated region (UTR) of the RILPL1 gene on chromosome 12q24."@en ;
