    rdfs:label "congenital myopathy 15"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A congenital myopathy that is characterized by symptom onset soon after birth and that has_material_basis_in heterozygous mutation in the TNNC2 gene on chromosome 20q13. Affected infants are hypotonic and have severe respiratory insufficiency and feeding problems, sometimes requiring mechanical ventilation or tube feeding."@en ;
