    rdfs:label "congenital myopathy 16"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A congenital myopathy that is characterized by onset of hypotonia and tremor in infancy and that has_material_basis_in heterozygous mutation in the MYBPC1 gene on chromosome 12q23. Patients have mildly delayed walking, unsteady gait, proximal muscle weakness, and a high-frequency tremor of the limbs."@en ;
