    obo:IAO_0000115 "A primary progressive aphasia that is characterized by language disturbance, including difficulty making or understanding speech. It is a type of primary progressive aphasia. Affected individuals have slow, hesitant speech due to difficulty retrieving the correct words, names, or numbers."@en ;
