    obo:IAO_0000115 "A nonparalytic poliomyelitis that results_in destruction located_in motor neurons, has_material_basis_in Human poliovirus 3, which is transmitted_by ingestion of food or water contaminated with feces, or transmitted_by direct contact with the oral secretions. The infection has_symptom fever, has_symptom sore throat, has_symptom headache, has_symptom vomiting, has_symptom fatigue, has_symptom neck stiffness, and has_symptom muscle spasms."@en ;
