    rdfs:label "hypopigmentation of eyelid"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A pigmentation disease that is characterized by loss of pigmentation of the eyelid and has_symptom white or light macules or patches on the eyelid, and has_material_basis_in autoimmune conditions like vitiligo, chronic inflammation, malignancy, or exposure to destructive substances."@en ;
