    obo:IAO_0000115 "A cryptococcosis that results_in inflammation located_in meninges, has_material_basis_in Cryptococcus neoformans and has_symptom headache, has_symptom nausea, has_symptom staggering gait, has_symptom dementia, has_symptom blurred vision and has_symptom confusion."@en ;
