    obo:IAO_0000115 "An adenovirus infectious disease that results_in inflammation located_in meninges, has_material_basis_in Human adenovirus 3 or has_material_basis_in Human adenovirus 7 and has_symptom fever, has_symptom headache, has_symptom stiff neck, and has_symptom confusion."@en ;
