    obo:IAO_0000115 "A viral infectious disease that results_in infection in ruminants, has_material_basis_in Bluetongue virus, which is transmitted_by Culicoides imicola midge. The infection has_symptom fever, has_symptom excessive salivation, has_symptom swelling of the face and tongue, and has_symptom cyanosis of the tongue."@en ;
