    obo:IAO_0000115 "A brucellosis that involves an infection caused by Brucella melitensis in cattle, goats, sheep and humans. The disease has_symptom fever, has_symptom malaise, has_symptom anorexia, has_symptom limb pain and has_symptom back pain."@en ;
