    obo:IAO_0000115 "An ectodermal dysplasia characterized by distinctive facial features, hydronephrosis, severe developmental delay, typical skeletal malformations, genital and cardiac anomalies, and increased tumor prevalence that has_material_basis_in heterozygous mutation in the SETBP1 gene on chromosome 18q12.3."@en ;
