    rdfs:label "anogenital venereal wart"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A viral infectious disease that results_in infection located_in skin of vagina, cervix, uterus, anus, penis, scrotum, mouth, or throat, has_material_basis_in human papillomaviruses (types 6 and 11), which are transmitted_by direct contact with the skin during oral, genital, or anal sex with an infected partner. The infection has_symptom anogenital warts."@en ;
