    owl:annotatedProperty obo:IAO_0000115 ;
    owl:annotatedSource obo:DOID_14476 ;
    owl:annotatedTarget "A severe acute respiratory syndrome that results_in infection located_in lungs, has_material_basis_in SARS coronavirus (SARS-CoV), which is transmitted_by droplet spread of respiratory secretions, transmitted_by ingestion of contaminated food, or transmitted_by fomites. The infection has_symptom fever, has_symptom myalgia, has_symptom lethargy, has_symptom cough, has_symptom sore throat, has_symptom shortness of breath, and other breathing difficulties which may lead to death as a result of respiratory failure."@en .

