    owl:annotatedTarget "A syndrome characterized by neurodevelopmental delay, hypotonia, dysmorphic features, and growth restriction with or without structural brain abnormalities that has_material_basis_in homozygous mutation in the WSB2 gene on chromosome 12q24."@en .

