    owl:annotatedTarget "A viral infectious disease that results_in infection in horses, mules, donkeys and zebras located_in lung, has_material_basis_in African horsesickness virus, which is transmitted_by biting midge, Culicoides imicola, transmitted_by Culex mosquito, transmitted_by Anopheles mosquito, transmitted_by Aedes mosquito, transmitted_by Hyalomma tick, and transmitted_by Rhipicephalus tick. The infection has_symptom tachypnea, has_symptom forced expiration, has_symptom profuse sweating, has_symptom spasmodic coughing, and has_symptom ecchymoses on the tongue."@en .

